title: cursor:first
tags: [[GUI command]] [[Generic panel commands]]
kind: reference
summary: Move a panel's cursor to the first row (self / a panel type)

Moves the cursor of a panel onto its first row — in the [[log panel]], the newest; in the [[recent panel]], the most recent ([[Generic panel commands]]).

In a panel without a cursor it scrolls what the panel shows to the top instead ([[Generic panel commands]]).
